[00:09.69]1. Life everlasting is promised.
[00:13.59]Our earthly home will endure.
[00:18.72]‘Meek ones will thrive,’ said the psalmist.
[00:23.14]This grand future is sure.
[00:25.37](Chorus)
[00:27.60]We can live forever.
[00:32.20]It’s worth all endeavor.
[00:36.60]God’s promise is faithful.
[00:41.16]His Word will come true.
[00:52.51]2. Paradise brought to perfection;
[00:56.81]All of God’s children set free.
[01:01.37]Under Jehovah’s direction,
[01:05.83]Peace on earth we will see.
[01:08.08](Chorus)
[01:10.33]We can live forever.
[01:14.79]It’s worth all endeavor.
[01:19.39]God’s promise is faithful.
[01:23.71]His Word will come true.
[01:35.04]3. Soon in the grand resurrection,
[01:44.04]Sorrow will all disappear.
[01:46.29]Showering tender affection,
[01:48.54]God will dry ev’ry tear.
[01:50.79](Chorus)
[01:53.04]We can live forever.
[01:57.69]It’s worth all endeavor.
[02:01.69]God’s promise is faithful.
[02:06.69]His Word will come true.